# MSVR: Multivariate Support Vector Regression

This repository contains the code, experiments and results developed for my thesis on multivariate time series forecasting using Multivariate Support Vector Regression (MSVR).

## Objective
The main objective of this research is to evaluate the predictive performance of MSVR and compare it with classical multivariate time series models, as well as others supervised machine learning approaches. 

## Methodologies included
- VAR
- VEC
- MSETAR
- MSVR

## Tools and technologies
- Python
- R

